        "NkLZkuMIVqAZJgXl": {
          "active_target": "One Creature",
          "attack_description": "<p>Deal <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-id=\"XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Physical</strong></a>&nbsp;damage to one creature.</p><p>The strike takes on the Asura's current Aspect:</p><ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-id=\"5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Bolt</strong></a>&nbsp;— the target is left <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.GqqgHkKOs0hkghdG\" data-id=\"GqqgHkKOs0hkghdG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Paralyzed</strong></a>.</p></li><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-id=\"0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Fire</strong></a>&nbsp;— the strike gains <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.NUaxIAIPUu5Qnk8l\" data-id=\"NUaxIAIPUu5Qnk8l\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Overflow</strong></a>.</p></li><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-id=\"Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Ice</strong></a>&nbsp;— the target is left <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.MM2SvLRyVhazkNq3\" data-id=\"MM2SvLRyVhazkNq3\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Disarmed</strong></a>.</p></li><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Air</strong></a>&nbsp;— the target is left <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.Q8FTFPsXVpNj2zxT\" data-id=\"Q8FTFPsXVpNj2zxT\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Silence</strong></a>d.</p></li></ul>",
          "attribute_die1": "DEX",
