        "NFruWlBHrgfNSJmM": {
          "active_cost": "60 MP",
          "active_description": "<p>The Asura's four blades fall in a single flurry. Deal <strong>devastating</strong> <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-id=\"5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Bolt</strong></a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-id=\"0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Fire</strong></a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-id=\"Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Ice</strong></a>&nbsp;and <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Air</strong></a>&nbsp;damage — four separate strikes, each landing automatically on a random foe.</p><p>Afterwards the Asura loses all of its Aspects and lit blades, and is <strong>Vulnerable</strong> to all four elements again.</p>",
