          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Ascension",
          "passive_description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-id=\"P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Trigger</strong></a>&nbsp;When the Asura suffers <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-id=\"0sFCVCoM6FRrQP2f\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Fire</strong></a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-id=\"5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Bolt</strong></a>, <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-id=\"Osq3NN3QCtiW7otU\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Ice</strong></a>&nbsp;or <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-id=\"imkMQLnCLaFbaS6Y\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Air</strong></a>&nbsp;damage.</p></li></ul><p>The Asura lights the blade of that element permanently. It is <strong>Vulnerable</strong> to each element until that blade is lit, and <strong>Resistant</strong> to it afterwards. Its Elemental Slash deals <strong>8</strong> extra damage for each lit blade.</p><p>Its own Sword Enchants light blades the same way an enemy's damage does. With all four blades lit, the Asura can use <strong>Asura Strike</strong>.</p>",
