          "name": "Elemental Aspect",
          "passive_description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-id=\"P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Trigger</strong></a>&nbsp;When the Asura takes elemental damage.</p></li></ul><p>The Asura gains the Aspect of the triggering element, replacing any Aspect it currently holds.</p>",
