          "name": "Four-Armed Fury",
          "passive_description": "<p>The Asura acts four times each round and enters every conflict with no MP. While in <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-id=\"GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Crisis</strong></a>, its Elemental Slash deals <strong>20</strong> extra damage.</p>",
