      "study_text": "<p>Not a demon — a <strong>demi-god</strong>, and it will say so between blows. Strike it with an element and one of its four blades takes the flame: it will never be caught by that element twice, but a blade it has not yet lit is still an open wound. In this valley the <strong>storm</strong> lights one for it before the fight even starts. When all four burn at once, step back — and when they go out, that is your moment.</p>",
